  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling Up Family Planning Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide a broad range of inclusive family planning services to rural and urban areas (particularly long-acting revisable and permanent methods) in consultation with the Government of Tanzania.   To strengthen Comprehensive Post-Abortion Care (CPAC) commodities and services.  To appropriately respond to Gender-Based Violence (GBV) at the community and healthcare level.   To improve the availability of family planning commodities from the national to the health facility level.   To strengthen the health system through improvement of the family planning commodities supply chain and lobbying for policy change.</narrative>
  </description>
